Hi Greta,

1. Activity, not logins. A seat counts as active if it created, moved or acknowledged at least one item in the week. A login with no action doesn't count, so Martin's suspicion, if true, isn't inflating the number.
2. Reno is at the pilot rate ($140/seat/month) through the end of the pilot on May 1; after that it moves to the plant rate unless we fold it into the renewal, which I'd suggest.

Tell Martin I'm happy to get on a call anytime!

